/*!
\page page_sttofslat StTofSlat

\brief Legacy STAR TOF scintillator slat matched to a reconstructed track.

\section tofslat_overview Overview

StTofSlat represents a scintillator slat from the earliest STAR TOF programme (TOFr slats,
approximately Runs 1–4), before the MRPC-based detectors were deployed.
Each slat is a plastic scintillator strip read from one end by a photomultiplier,
providing a single ADC amplitude and TDC timing value.

\note Fully superseded by \ref StTofCell (MRPC era) and then \ref StBTofHit (BTOF, Run 8+).

Objects are stored in \ref StTofCollection via StEvent::tofCollection().

\section tofslat_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
TObject → StObject → StTofSlat
\endcode

\section tofslat_members Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| mSlatIndex | UShort_t | Global slat identifier |
| mAdc | UShort_t | Raw ADC value (pulse height) |
| mTdc | UShort_t | Raw TDC value (timing count) |
| mAssociatedTrack | StLink<StTrack> | Matched reconstructed track |
| mZhit | Float_t | z-position of hit [cm] |
| mHitProf | UShort_t | Hit profile bitmask |
| mMatchFlag | UShort_t | Track-to-slat matching quality flag |
| mPosition | StThreeVectorF | Full 3D hit position [cm] |

\section tofslat_methods Key Methods

- slatIndex() — global slat index
- adc() — raw ADC value
- tdc() — raw TDC value
- associatedTrack() — pointer to matched StTrack
- zHit() — z-position of hit [cm]
- hitProf() — hit profile bitmask
- matchFlag() — match quality flag
- position() — 3D hit position [cm]

\section tofslat_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
// Early STAR run data (scintillator-slat TOFr era, Runs 1–4)
StTofCollection* coll = event->tofCollection();
if (coll) {
    const StSPtrVecTofSlat& slats = coll->tofSlats();
    for (const auto& s : slats) {
        unsigned short idx  = s->slatIndex();
        unsigned short adc  = s->adc();
        float          zHit = s->zHit();
    }
}
\endcode

\see StTofCell, StTofHit, StTofCollection
*/
